      "responseContract": "appcall-provider-json-v1",
      "adaptations": [
        "Credential-only healthcheck maps to POST /getquota, the documented quota probe and pinned credential validator. Register and real-time lookup are omitted as writes or billed tracking actions.",
        "Official bash curl omits --data; PHP/source send JSON array []. Native sends [].",
        "Native category is ecommerce rather than shipping: 17TRACK is a shipment-tracking API, but Rust CATEGORIES has no shipping bucket.",
        "HTTP 200 illegal-parameter envelopes {code:0,data.errors:[...]} are demoted via bodyErrorPaths [data.errors]. code is not used because 0 would trip a numeric path.",
        "Returns raw 17TRACK JSON under data instead of the pinned quota camelCase wrapper."
      ]
    },
